DESCRIPTION:The Blue Angels fly their home show off Casino Beach over four
  days in July\, and the beach itself is free to sit on. Santa Rosa Island
  Authority has posted the dates and says the running order is still to be
  determined. In past years the Friday dress rehearsal has been the local 
 move\, because it is the same flight with a thinner crowd\, and this page
  will carry the real times for each day as soon as the authority publishe
 s them.\nPrice: Free\nArea: Pensacola Beach & Perdido\nTimes: Tue 7/14 to
  Sat 7/17 · the running order is not published yet\nChecked against the 
 venue's own page on 2026-09-02\nhttps://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-ai
 rshow.html
